Accelergy / CACTI
    The characterization database was built with a modified Accelergy CACTI
    estimation plug-in and component tables derived from CACTI and Aladdin
    characterization data. That build pipeline is not in this repository; an
    earlier version of it is in the Zenodo code archive
    (doi:10.5281/zenodo.21524898). The ERT summaries in src/scripts/ert/ and the
    component areas in src/timeloop_experiments/compute_area.py are Accelergy
    outputs.
    Accelergy: https://github.com/Accelergy-Project/accelergy
    CACTI:     https://github.com/HewlettPackard/cacti

Timeloop
    The characterization database distributed via Zenodo was produced with
    Timeloop. Timeloop itself is not vendored here.
    https://github.com/NVlabs/timeloop
